---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import HeroCta from '../components/HeroCta.astro';
const form='https://forms.gle/6dmPZJowfUUC3jiZ7';
const faqs=[['Can I join as a beginner?','The registration form welcomes beginner, intermediate, and advanced practitioners. Share your experience and any individual needs when registering so you can discuss suitability with Arveen.'],['Where do the classes take place?','Classes are online. Follow the instructions in the registration form; the form says registered participants will be added to the class group.'],['What should I have ready?','A comfortable space to move, a yoga mat, and a device with a stable internet connection. Check any additional requirements with the instructor before your first class.'],['How do I register?','Open the registration form, choose a batch and plan, and follow its payment and confirmation instructions. Read the current terms before making a payment.'],['What if I have a health condition?','Tell the instructor about any health conditions or injuries in the registration form, and discuss whether the class is appropriate for you before joining.']];
---
<PageLayout title="Yoga" eyebrow="Practice with Arveen" heading="Make a little room for yourself." description="Online yoga classes that bring movement, guided meditation, and daily practice into your own space.">
<div slot="intro" class="page-actions"><HeroCta href={form} label="View registration form" /><a class="text-link" href="#batches">Find your batch ↓</a></div>
<section class="content-wrap yoga-overview"><div class="yoga-intention"><span class="item-number">A regular rhythm</span><h2>Show up.<br />Take your time.<br />Begin again.</h2><p>A shared space for yoga and guidance on building a more intentional routine. Join from home, whether you’re in India or abroad.</p></div><div class="class-facts"><div><span>Format</span><strong>Online classes</strong></div><div><span>Practice days</span><strong>Monday to Friday</strong></div><div><span>Session length</span><strong>50–60 minutes</strong></div><div><span>Your teacher</span><strong>Arveen Poonia</strong></div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G6urhfhD7eA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch Arveen’s yoga journey ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section-block sage-section" id="batches"><div class="content-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A time that fits your day</p><h2>Begin with a rhythm.</h2></div><span class="small-note">All times are Indian Standard Time (UTC+5:30)</span></div><div class="batch-grid"><div class="batch-card"><span class="eyebrow">Morning batch</span><h3>6:00 <span>AM</span></h3><p>A little space before the day begins.</p><span>Monday–Friday · 50–60 minutes</span></div><div class="batch-card"><span class="eyebrow">Evening batch</span><h3>7:00 <span>PM</span></h3><p>Return to your practice at the end of the day.</p><span>Monday–Friday · 50–60 minutes</span></div></div><div class="plan-grid">{[['1 month','₹1,500'],['3 months','₹4,000'],['6 months','₹7,000']].map(([period,price])=><div><span>{period}</span><strong>{price}</strong></div>)}</div><p class="small-note">Listed in the registration form, checked 16 September 2026. Confirm current batches, fees, and terms in the form before paying.</p><div class="page-actions"><HeroCta href={form} label="Choose your batch" /></div></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><div class="content-wrap faq-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you begin</p><h2>A few things<br />you might wonder.</h2><a class="text-link" href="mailto:arveenpoonia0101@gmail.com">Ask about classes ↗</a></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
</PageLayout>
